OL,3,CReality TV star Georgia Toffolo
OL,4,Creveals she escaped French wildfires
OL,6,FReality TV star Georgia Toffolo has
OL,7,Frevealed she narrowly escaped the
OL,8,FFrench wildfires with her husband,
OL,9,FBrewdog co-founder James Watt.
OL,11,FThe 31-year-old said she was on
OL,12,Fholiday with family in Cap Ferret last
OL,13,Fweek and left the place she was
OL,14,Fstaying earlier than planned as she
OL,15,Fcould smell the fires, adding in a
OL,16,Fpost on her Instagram story that she
OL,17,Fis "praying that everyone's OK".
OL,26,@yD@DOUyD@_O]
