OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785064700
OL,3,CReality TV star Georgia Toffolo
OL,4,Creveals she escaped French wildfires
OL,6,FThe former Made In Chelsea star said:
OL,7,F"We were just watching the news, and
OL,8,Fjust so you can understand, we were on
OL,9,Fholiday there for a week, and then we
OL,10,Fwere at lunch with friends on
OL,11,FThursday, and... we knew about the
OL,12,Ffire, but at that point it was quite
OL,13,Ffar away.
OL,15,F"And our friends were like: 'Oh God,
OL,16,Fit's really getting bad', and they
OL,17,Flive there, so they were a bit more
OL,18,Fplugged in than us, and anyway, at
OL,19,Fthat point, everyone was like...
OL,20,F'everything's OK, just stay put'.
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
