PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785064700
OL,3,CReality TV star Georgia Toffolo
OL,4,Creveals she escaped French wildfires
OL,6,F"But the problem is with these
OL,7,Fwildfires, when the wind changes
OL,8,Fdirection, the situation changes
OL,9,Freally quickly, so we were meant to be
OL,10,Fleaving on Friday anyway to fly up
OL,11,Fhere, so we were dropping the kids off
OL,12,Fand then flying up... we're in Iceland
OL,13,Fnow.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
