PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785064700
OL,3,CReality TV star Georgia Toffolo
OL,4,Creveals she escaped French wildfires
OL,6,F"But James just said to me on
OL,7,FThursday, we had four children with
OL,8,Fus, he was just like: 'I don't like
OL,9,Fit,' and we could smell stuff and
OL,10,Fthere was like little bits of ash
OL,11,Ffalling, so we got everyone packed up
OL,12,Fand anyway, we left by boat because
OL,13,Fthe road was closed on Thursday and
OL,14,Fstayed at the airport on Thursday
OL,15,Fnight.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
