FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785064700
OL,3,CReality TV star Georgia Toffolo
OL,4,Creveals she escaped French wildfires
OL,6,F"And our flights were already booked
OL,7,Freally early on Friday morning, but I
OL,8,Fjust can't stop thinking about (it), I
OL,9,Fmean, it was really quite distressing
OL,10,Fto see because it just increased and
OL,11,Fincreased."
OL,13,FToffolo went on to say that they were
OL,14,F"very lucky" as they left shortly
OL,15,Fbefore an evacuation of the area on
OL,16,FFriday.
OL,18,FShe added: "It's just so awful, and so
OL,19,Fmany firefighters have been injured,
OL,20,Fand it's just a really horrible
OL,21,Fsituation...
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@KO]vD@AOUvD@LO]zD@LOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
