PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785064700
OL,3,CReality TV star Georgia Toffolo
OL,4,Creveals she escaped French wildfires
OL,6,F"I just really hope everyone's OK, but
OL,7,Ffrom everything that we saw, like it
OL,8,Fwas being handled amazingly by the
OL,9,Fauthorities, but they must be under so
OL,10,Fmuch pressure, and just like a really
OL,11,Fhorrible, awful thing to happen."
OL,13,FA quarter of a million people have
OL,14,Freportedly fled their homes since the
OL,15,Ffires broke out in southern Europe on
OL,16,FWednesday.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@aO]
