OL,3,CReality TV star Georgia Toffolo
OL,4,Creveals she escaped French wildfires
OL,6,FToffolo is best known for her regular
OL,7,Fappearances in E4's Made In Chelsea
OL,8,Fbetween 2014 and 2018, and was also
OL,9,Fcrowned queen of the jungle on I'm a
OL,10,FCelebrity... Get Me Out of Here! in
OL,11,Fthe ITV reality show's 17th series in
OL,12,F2017.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
